>>
Rule 16 (The out tensor should not be of bool or string type.)
{v_2 : tensor} |= if v_2 ≠ "none" then (dtype_(v_2) ≠ 0 ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≠ 11)
>>
Rule 17 (Expit API cannot accept empty tensor.)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
